WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
Comparing competitors by hand takes hours.

2
00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:06.000
This research agent does it for you:

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:09.520
give it a few links and a question,

4
00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:12.110
and it reads each site in a real browser —

5
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.263
on my laptop, with no cloud AI.

6
00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.790
Here I ask which of three well-known link-building

7
00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:24.700
guides gives a small agency the most practical advice.

8
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.530
It opens every site by itself.

9
00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:29.690
The verdict:

10
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:33.800
Backlinko wins with ninety-five out of a hundred —

11
00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:37.190
over a hundred and seventy concrete strategies.

12
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:41.130
Ahrefs gets eighty-five, and Moz seventy-five.

13
00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:45.720
Every confident fact has a quote behind it.

14
00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:49.430
The hundred and seventy comes straight from the page —

15
00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:53.850
and if a quote isn't really there, the fact is thrown out.

16
00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:58.250
It also tells you what it didn't finish reading —

17
00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:01.010
here, two of the three sites.

18
00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:05.210
That line is written by code, so it's never skipped.

19
00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:10.730
It reads a page, plans the next step and acts —

20
00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.870
and fourteen hard rules are checked

21
00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.570
in code before any action reaches the browser.

22
00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:18.480
Anything that can't be undone,

23
00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:21.550
like paying, it leaves to a person.

24
00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.420
Four hundred and fifty-one automated tests,

25
00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:30.950
thirty-one real websites in the log, and the code is open.

26
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.370
Need a bot like this for your market?

27
00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:34.620
Message me.
